kernel	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-22T13:57:48.1648050Z # iOS 16 (xnu-8796) kernel configuration for the DroidVM guest: crosvm on Gunyah, SM8650.
kernel	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-22T13:57:48.1658720Z #
kernel	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-22T13:57:48.1669270Z # Derived from N1709/UniXNU-whyred's configs/whyred_defconfig (the only published iOS 16
kernel	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-22T13:57:48.1670190Z # board that gets as far as a kernel) with the two board-specific bits changed:
kernel	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-22T13:57:48.1671080Z #   - no CONFIG_XNU_NATIVE_PAN=n: Kryo 260 is ARMv8.0 and cannot run the PAN sequence,
kernel	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-22T13:57:48.1671780Z #     SM8650 is ARMv8.7 and does have PSTATE.PAN;
kernel	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-22T13:57:48.1672490Z #   - CONFIG_XNU_BUILD_ARCHIVES=y, because this board's archives (board.toml [kernel]
kernel	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-22T13:57:48.1673060Z #     archives) are how corecrypto/pthread/AES/ArmCpu enter the link.
kernel	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-22T13:57:48.1673620Z #
kernel	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-22T13:57:48.1674110Z # The OS layer's own fragment (os:configs/ios.config in S7) is already folded in here:
kernel	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-22T13:57:48.1674880Z # TRUST_CACHE_RUNTIME, SOURCE_MOCKFS, NATIVE_CS_HASH_CACHE, CRYPTO_BOOTSTRAP="prelinked".
kernel	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-22T13:57:48.1675600Z #
kernel	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-22T13:57:48.1676190Z # First milestone was a kernel. It boots: AMFI is past, PE_init returns, IOCatalogue
kernel	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-22T13:57:48.1676990Z # builds, and the only remaining panic is "Failed to mount root device" -- because the
kernel	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-22T13:57:48.1679550Z # board had no storage transport at all. ios16's KernelConfigTables.cpp already carries
kernel	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-22T13:57:48.1680230Z # the `XNU_NATIVE_VIRTIO_BLOCK` personality (IOClass NativeVirtioBlock over
kernel	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-22T13:57:48.1681240Z # IOPlatformDevice), and build-xnu-4k-baseline.sh force-loads
kernel	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-22T13:57:48.1681890Z # build/virtio-mmio-block/libVirtioMmioBlock.a when this is 1, so storage is one switch
kernel	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-22T13:57:48.1683230Z # plus one archive builder (boards/ios16/make-board.py). Display, GPU and owner-root stay
kernel	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-22T13:57:48.1683860Z # off for now, as the whyred board has them.
kernel	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-22T13:57:48.1684240Z CONFIG_XNU_BUILD_ARCHIVES=y
kernel	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-22T13:57:48.1686880Z CONFIG_XNU_NATIVE_VIRTIO_BLOCK=y
kernel	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-22T13:57:48.1687910Z CONFIG_XNU_ARM_DT_PLATFORM=y
kernel	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-22T13:57:48.1688950Z CONFIG_XNU_ARMCPU=y
kernel	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-22T13:57:48.1689540Z CONFIG_XNU_SOURCE_CORECRYPTO14=y
kernel	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-22T13:57:48.1690100Z CONFIG_XNU_SOURCE_PTHREAD=y
kernel	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-22T13:57:48.1690790Z CONFIG_XNU_NATIVE_AES=y
kernel	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-22T13:57:48.1691150Z CONFIG_XNU_NATIVE_ARCH_TIMER=y
kernel	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-22T13:57:48.1691590Z CONFIG_XNU_TRUST_CACHE_RUNTIME=y
kernel	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-22T13:57:48.1692140Z # 8796's public mockfs sources are incomplete (mockfs_fsnode.c needs the private enum) and this
kernel	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-22T13:57:48.1692890Z # board mounts the payload's real APFS volumes; fixup-8796.py also turns the four #if MOCKFS
kernel	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-22T13:57:48.1693580Z # blocks in vfs_conf.c off. build-xnu-4k-baseline.sh otherwise insists on libmockfs_fixture.a.
